I[44]="PRACTISE Wildcard on defence — the chapter's mid-way breather: the Switchers call balls 1, 3, 5 face-up. Aha: the swap works on your ANSWER: when Fakhar calls Runs 1866, swap Nabi's 2300 onto Pathirane (Runs 6) and answer with Pathirane — he wins the ball, and Nabi keeps his 99 wickets and Catches 65 for your own calls. Concede what nobody can beat (Southee's 164 wickets, Dhonni's Average 37.6) with your cheapest card."
I[46]="COMBINE fog + Wildcard, trimmed to two rules (no stances: one decision per ball). Their called card is face-down, but the stat narrows it: Strike Rate means Suryakumaar (167) or Markkram (144); Economy means Suryakumaar (6.25), Mehidyy (7.00) or Norrtje (7.01); Average means Suryakumaar, Root (35.7) or Markkram. Aha: while Suryakumaar is unplayed only Kohli's Average 48.7 / Runs 4188 is safe against a fogged batting call — so read the call, then use the Wildcard on the fogged ANSWER: swap Kohli's Runs onto a spare card to win a Runs call and keep Kohli's Average for later."
I[47]="BREATHER with the Wildcard, trimmed to one decision per ball (no stances): a soft Crew (Pathirane, Shaanaka, Wood, Starc) with two real bats, Babbar (Runs 4223) and Brookk (SR 145). Win easily; 3 stars ask for two boundaries and a 10-run win. Aha: the Wildcard is a boundary-maker — swap Russell's Strike Rate 162 onto the card you call with and its Strike Rate call clears the rope against their bowlers; the swap MOVES the number (Russell takes the lower one), so spend Russell later on his 61 wickets."
I[48]="SPIKE fog + Mega Pot: dead heats stack (2 runs each, up to 8) and carry. Three of theirs never bowl (Gill, Klaassen, Gurbaz) and three of yours never bowl (Nissaanka, Zadran, Rizwaan) — once Adiil Rashid, Nabi and Muraali are spent, your non-bowler's Wickets call is a sure tie and the pot grows. Aha (a fair fog read): a fogged Wickets/Economy call can only be one of their three bowlers — Santner's 120 wickets beat Nabi and Muraali (not Rashid's 126) — and a fogged batting call is a keeper/opener, which Rizwaan's Runs 3414 / Average 47.4 beat. 3 stars: bank a pot."
