I[51]="MIXED: ODI weights (Average and Wickets x1.5) in the fog, against honest gamblers: their swipe is a tell — Aggressive means a strong number. Their ODI aces: Dhonni (Runs 10773, Average 50.6), Zadran (Average 49.1), Nissaanka (41.9) and the wicket-takers Adiil Rashid (207) and Cummins (141). Aha: a fogged Average call is one of their three batters — Babbar's 54.1 beats all three; a fogged Wickets call is a bowler — Vettoori's 305 beats all of them. Keep Babbar and Vettoori for those reads; make your own calls with Buttler's Strike Rate 117 (tops all six) and Rabada's Economy 5.08 (beaten only by Sammi's 4.94)."
